{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20070","headline":"宿空侄院寄澹公 · 孟郊","name":"宿空侄院寄澹公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜坐冷竹声，二三高人语。\n灯窗看律钞，小师别爲侣。\n雪檐晴滴滴，茗椀华举举。\n磬音多风飙，声韵闻江楚。\n官街不相隔，诗思空愁予。\n明日策杖归，去住两延伫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}